    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nNo. 4 Droim na Cille is an impressive, detached five bedroom home, with the added bonus of a self contained 1 bedroom annex, located in a quiet, now well established development and situated within walking distance of Loughrea town centre and all it's social and recreational amenities.\n\nLocated approximately 10 minute drive from M6 motorway, this spacious detached family home boasts all rooms of generous proportions and is presented for sale in excellent condition, affording one the opportunity here to acquire a quality home in a most convenient location.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and can be arranged through selling agent."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - 2.08m x 5.44m\nFront aspect window and door, tile flooring\n\nSitting Room - 4.25m x 5.19m\nFront aspect bay window, solid fuel fireplace with surround, wooden flooring\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 6.45m x 3.89m\nRear aspect window and sliding door, fitted wall and base units, tile flooring\n\nGround Floor wc - 0.76m x 1.61m\nwhb/wc, tile flooring\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 3.93m x 2.71m\nHotpress/airing cupboard off, stira stairs to attic (attic fully floored for storage), wooden flooring\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.82m x 3.06m\nFront aspect window, fitted wardrobes, wooden flooring - En-suite: 2.50m x 1.02m - Side aspect window, whb/wc/electric shower, walls partially tiled, tile flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.57m x 3.63m\nFront aspect window, fitted wardrobe, wooden flooring\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.94m x 3.44m\nSide aspect window, fitted wardrobe, wooden flooring -En-suite: 2.97m x 2.13m - Side aspect skylight, whb/wc/electric shower, partially tiled, tile flooring\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.87m x 2.99m\nRear aspect window, fitted wardrobe, wooden flooring\n\nBedroom 5 - 3.53m x 2.63m\nRear aspect window, fitted wardrobe, wooden flooring\n\nBathroom - 2.47m x 1.68m\nRear aspect windows, whb/wc/bath with overhead shower, walls partially tiled, tile flooring\n\nOutside - \nTarmac driveway to front of property with side access to rear garden. Rear of property has a patio and grass area with block wall boundary\n\nAnnex - \n\n\nAnnex - Kitchen/Living Room - 2.95m x 4.52m\nFront access sliding door, fitted wall and base units, wooden flooring\n\nAnnex - Bedroom - 2.99m x 3.39m\nRear aspect window, fitted storage, wooden flooring -Bathroom: 1.96m x 1.41m - Side aspect window, whb/wc/electric shower, walls partially tiled, tile flooring - Annex has it's own private outside area.\n\n"
      },
